49:- **The gallery.** Its tile sits in the **Imported** group, in rows of three, and previews the LUT on your frame like any [live thumbnail](/color/looks/#live-thumbnails). The tile's name is the file's name without `.cube`. With no LUTs in the project, the group isn't there.
